WEBVTT

01:04.580 --> 01:06.370
<i>10 minutes until atmospheric reentry.</i>

01:06.920 --> 01:08.170
<i>How's it looking for you?</i>

01:08.670 --> 01:10.380
<i>All the monitoring's been completed.</i>

01:10.630 --> 01:13.460
<i>I want to finish this quickly and go get a beer!</i>

01:13.460 --> 01:15.630
<i>Don't relax until we're done, okay?</i>

01:16.220 --> 01:18.390
<i>We have to get the cargo to its destination.</i>

01:18.680 --> 01:20.970
<i>Let's get wasted after that.</i>

01:21.220 --> 01:23.100
<i>Only if you're paying.</i>

01:24.140 --> 01:28.270
<i>It's the return of the Mars Exploration Vessel; the whole world has been waiting for it.</i>

01:31.150 --> 01:34.740
<i>I wonder what secrets it's going to reveal.</i>

01:36.780 --> 01:40.780
<i>That's enough chatter... get ready for reentry.</i>

01:41.030 --> 01:42.080
<i>Yeah.</i>

01:42.160 --> 01:44.160
<i>I'll do the final checks here.</i>

01:44.540 --> 01:45.540
<i>Hey!</i>

01:45.750 --> 01:46.830
<i>What are you doing?</i>

01:47.290 --> 01:48.450
<i>Stop kidding around!</i>

01:48.460 --> 01:49.080
<i>Stop!</i>

01:49.790 --> 01:50.840
<i>What's happening?</i>

01:50.880 --> 01:53.050
<i>We have an emergency situation.</i>

01:53.050 --> 01:54.960
<i>The controls aren't responding!</i>

01:54.960 --> 01:57.340
<i>Dammit... we're going to burn up!</i>

02:07.850 --> 02:17.360
A few months after the Mars Exploration Nave was burned ...

02:10.350 --> 02:17.360
and have fallen on Earth ...

02:12.400 --> 02:17.360
They have happened bizarre things in Tokyo ...

02:24.740 --> 02:32.710
The train from 19:25 to Shinjuku and Ikebukuro is about to arrive.

02:54.440 --> 02:56.030
Two Ancients found!

02:56.030 --> 02:57.690
Proceeding to eliminate them!

03:05.740 --> 03:07.410
There is a third!

03:07.620 --> 03:08.790
<i>Reinforcements are on their way!</i>

03:08.830 --> 03:09.910
Hang on!

03:58.170 --> 03:59.260
Takeru!

05:12.200 --> 05:14.160
This one's totally gone.

05:16.490 --> 05:18.750
– His brain waves are getting weaker!
– What about his heart?

05:19.460 --> 05:21.710
His heart rate is getting weaker!

05:24.840 --> 05:25.840
Yamabuki…

05:26.050 --> 05:28.720
How long are we going to keep doing this?

05:29.220 --> 05:32.180
– Heart and lung functions have ceased!
– Get a heart massage ready!

05:37.690 --> 05:39.560
You will wear the MARS.

05:41.650 --> 05:42.820
No!

05:43.070 --> 05:45.280
Why do I have to?

05:46.530 --> 05:48.320
You have the capability.

05:49.070 --> 05:50.580
More than anyone else does....

05:51.450 --> 05:54.410
And you will fight the Ancients!

05:57.250 --> 05:58.120
No…

05:58.670 --> 05:59.830
I know!

06:00.210 --> 06:03.420
I know what happened to the people who
couldn't handle wearing the MARS!

06:06.010 --> 06:08.760
You just want to show off your MARS, dad!

06:10.180 --> 06:13.010
You don't care about me at all.

06:13.220 --> 06:14.060
Shut up!

06:15.520 --> 06:16.770
What are you doing, Dad?

06:17.020 --> 06:17.520
Stop!

06:23.360 --> 06:25.110
Alright, we've brought him back.

06:25.230 --> 06:26.440
Get me some heart stimulants.

06:40.120 --> 06:44.750
It's been decided to bring the fallen fragments of
the Mars Exploratory Vessel back to America.

06:46.130 --> 06:48.130
To America?

06:49.680 --> 06:53.350
We, the AAST, have been ordered to take them to the airplane.

06:54.390 --> 06:58.930
Then, there really is a connection between
the Ancients and the Exploratory Vessel?

06:59.600 --> 07:02.900
Too many strange things have been
happening to think that there's nothing.

07:03.400 --> 07:05.980
Are the repairs to the MARS suit finished?

07:06.190 --> 07:08.320
Yes, we've managed, somehow.

07:08.610 --> 07:10.490
– But...
– But?

07:11.110 --> 07:14.280
Takeru underwent considerable shock...

07:21.370 --> 07:23.170
We need him to go.

07:24.880 --> 07:28.670
That was his destiny,
as he was born to the Hinata family.

07:29.720 --> 07:34.970
None of us wanted to get caught up in this either, right?

07:43.060 --> 07:46.650
A special team formed to protect the citizenny

07:47.110 --> 07:50.280
from the mysterious monsters called "Ancients".

07:52.700 --> 07:57.410
It's made up of people taken from various police organizations.

07:59.870 --> 08:06.960
Each is an expert in something: hand-to-hand combat,
swordfighting, firearms, or information analysis.

08:07.590 --> 08:10.340
But then there is Hinata Takeru,

08:10.340 --> 08:13.220
Before he came here, he was a typical school student.

08:13.300 --> 08:19.600
None of us have ever been told why he wears the
special Anti-Aciente Suit, MARS, and fights with us.

08:20.270 --> 08:23.810
This is a lot of security just to carry
fragments of the Exploratory Vessel.

09:07.400 --> 09:11.480
I don't really know the connection,
but since we've been assigned to it.

09:12.360 --> 09:19.070
Don't you think maybe the Ancients might be after it?

09:19.740 --> 09:22.040
Yamabuki, do you know something about it?

09:22.160 --> 09:23.410
Not at all!

09:23.410 --> 09:25.370
I just kind of feel that way.

09:25.620 --> 09:28.540
<i>Both of you, stop the chit-chat. We're on security duty!</i>

09:29.420 --> 09:31.250
Aoi, concentrate on driving.

09:31.420 --> 09:33.960
Yamabuki, survey the surroundings carefully!

09:34.550 --> 09:36.220
Right right right...

09:36.220 --> 09:36.930
Roger!

10:34.190 --> 10:35.730
MARS suit equipped!

10:35.820 --> 10:37.990
Time Limit, Counter Start!

10:55.800 --> 10:57.130
Die!

11:19.320 --> 11:20.820
What is this thing?

11:21.200 --> 11:22.700
It's not the same Ancient we always fight…

11:23.450 --> 11:25.120
I'll handle him.

11:29.580 --> 11:30.790
You take the rest.

11:30.910 --> 11:31.870
Alright!

11:32.790 --> 11:35.210
Don't go on another rampage, okay?

12:39.190 --> 12:41.690
The plasma gun doesn't work on this thing?

12:59.210 --> 13:00.340
Tomoe!

13:15.140 --> 13:15.890
Takeru!

13:18.060 --> 13:18.980
Shizuka!

13:19.900 --> 13:23.070
The testing hasn't been finished yet,
but this is our only chance.

13:24.070 --> 13:25.700
A Plasma Rifle...

13:27.610 --> 13:29.200
But how do I use it?

13:29.780 --> 13:32.870
It's made to synchronize with the MARS suit.

13:33.330 --> 13:37.920
It takes some time to recharge it,
so make sure you hit it on the first try.

13:38.330 --> 13:41.840
It's also possible that it'll go out of control,
so use it when there's no one around.

13:42.000 --> 13:44.170
I don't know if I can do that!

13:47.260 --> 13:50.260
If you don't do it, everyone will die.

13:59.360 --> 14:01.320
Why you!

15:11.130 --> 15:15.180
America: National Research Institute

15:16.180 --> 15:18.230
I heard you had an awful time in Tokyo.

15:19.180 --> 15:23.690
The recovered parts of the Mars Exploratory
Vessel are safely on their way here.

15:23.810 --> 15:25.570
Thank you.

15:26.730 --> 15:32.700
From the data and pictures that were sent first,
we were able to get most of the big picture.

15:34.990 --> 15:37.160
You know their true identities then?

15:37.540 --> 15:38.450
Indeed.

15:38.620 --> 15:44.460
The analysis supports the theory that many
years ago, there was a civilization on mars.

15:46.060 --> 15:48.090
Meteors and other objects from Mars

15:48.090 --> 15:52.930
that fell to Earth millions and millions
of years ago have the same make-up.

15:54.220 --> 15:57.390
Also, the DNA recovered from them show that

15:57.770 --> 16:03.350
the life forms that existed on Mars were Homo Sapiens.

16:05.150 --> 16:06.650
What does that mean?

16:07.570 --> 16:15.370
Humanity itself was born
and influenced by the DNA from Mars.

16:15.490 --> 16:18.370
Humanity has roots in Japan?

16:18.660 --> 16:19.620
What idiocy!

16:19.790 --> 16:22.120
Then, what was that incident in Japan?

16:22.290 --> 16:24.500
What are those monsters?

16:31.670 --> 16:34.300
I'd like to investigate a bit more before I
hand this over to the research facility...

16:34.300 --> 16:35.140
Yes.

16:47.730 --> 16:49.190
It's still alive!

16:49.400 --> 16:51.150
Why is it alive?

16:51.240 --> 16:52.190
I don't know!

16:52.360 --> 16:53.570
Everybody get back!

16:56.660 --> 16:57.620
Takeru is…

16:59.660 --> 17:01.160
Don't forget…

17:01.700 --> 17:03.660
You can…

17:04.040 --> 17:05.420
You can talk?

17:07.170 --> 17:12.170
It was you who invaded this Earth.

17:15.760 --> 17:18.180
We are the Earthlings!

17:18.760 --> 17:23.430
The real Earthlings, released by the virus

17:23.930 --> 17:26.980
that wiped out the Martians!

17:49.340 --> 17:51.710
We invaded this planet?

17:52.420 --> 17:54.670
Invaded the Earth?
